  "title": "IELTS API: a free, no-authentication REST API and open dataset for IELTS preparation research",
  "description": "Archived release of the IELTS API source code and datasets. Cite this record, or the version-specific DOI, when you use the API or the datasets in research. Version 1.5.0 adds a retention layer: the Ebbinghaus (1885) savings data with three independent replications, and five published review schedulers reimplemented as stateless, deterministic endpoints.",
